### ===================================================================
### To-Do List REST API Testing File (VS Code REST Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@taskId = 6650a123456789abcdef0123

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1

### 2. Create Task (Standard Priority)
# @name createSampleTask1
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete MERN Week 2 Assignment",
  "description": "Implement CRUD REST API for To-Do tasks with Express and MongoDB",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-05T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### 3. Create Task (Low Priority)
# @name createSampleTask2
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review MongoDB indexing",
  "description": "Study text search and compound indexing strategies in Mongoose",
  "priority": "low"
}

### 4. Create Task (Validation Error - Missing Title)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This task is missing a required title",
  "priority": "medium"
}

### 5. Get All Tasks (Default pagination & sort)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks HTTP/1.1

### 6. Get Tasks Filtered by Completed Status (completed=false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?completed=false HTTP/1.1

### 7. Get Tasks Filtered by Priority (priority=high)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?priority=high HTTP/1.1

### 8. Search Tasks by Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?search=MERN HTTP/1.1

### 9. Get Tasks with Sorting (priority descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?sort=priority HTTP/1.1

### 10. Get Task Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/stats HTTP/1.1

### 11. Get Single Task by Valid ID (Replace with created _id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}} HTTP/1.1

### 12. Get Task by Invalid ObjectId (CastError test)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/invalid-id-12345 HTTP/1.1

### 13. Update Task (PUT /api/tasks/:id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete MERN Week 2 Assignment (Updated)",
  "description": "Added test cases and verified response schema",
  "priority": "high",
  "completed": true
}

### 14. Toggle Task Status (PATCH /api/tasks/:id/toggle)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/toggle HTTP/1.1

### 15. Delete Task by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}} HTTP/1.1

### 16. Test 404 on Undefined Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existing-route HTTP/1.1
